      "name": "Knight",
      "description": "You are a member of a noble house, but your status is not just one of birth but of service. You have been a knight in training for much of your life, learning the ways of combat, honor, and duty. You might be a landless knight serving as a protector to a powerful lord, or a member of a knightly order dedicated to a specific cause.",
